Midranda prepared a great plan. Who would have thought he would project part of his soul into the Shadow Dimension and use it to rescue his army?

The Igolanos, Asmodians and Sophetios are answering Midranda's call and attacking the continent. We must stop Midranda's call and keep more monsters from being sent to the Abyss of the Sea.

Our companions need help.

Please, go back to the Shadow Road and defeat Midranda's Specter.

When you are done, come talk to me again.
